  "The basic application of neural networks is function approximation, or regression. Approximate \\(u(x)=\\sin(4\\pi x)\\), \\(x\\in[0,1]\\), by a neural network function \\(u(x;W)\\) found by optimisation. Choose collocation points \\(x_i = 0.01\\times i\\), \\(i=0,1,\\dots,100\\). The unknowns are the weights \\(W\\), and the loss function is": "Penerapan dasar jaringan saraf adalah aproksimasi fungsi, atau regresi. Aproksimasikan \\(u(x)=\\sin(4\\pi x)\\), \\(x\\in[0,1]\\), dengan fungsi jaringan saraf \\(u(x;W)\\) yang dicari melalui optimisasi. Pilih titik kolokasi \\(x_i = 0.01\\times i\\), \\(i=0,1,\\dots,100\\). Yang tidak diketahui adalah bobot \\(W\\), dan fungsi loss-nya adalah",
